    {
      "id": "W7224963368",
      "doi": "10.1364/ol.619906",
      "title": "On the Necessity of Blind Phase Search for Longitudinal Power Profile Estimation",
      "authors": [
        "Yuhua Chen",
        "Junjiang Xiang",
        "Chao Li",
        "Gai Zhou",
        "Meng Xiang",
        "Zhixue He",
        "Songnian Fu",
        "Yuwen Qin"
      ],
      "year": 2026,
      "venue": "Optics Letters",
      "venue_abbr": "OL",
      "rank_label": "CIE T2 · 2023",
      "keywords": [
        "blind phase search",
        "phase retrieval"
      ],
      "url": "https://doi.org/10.1364/ol.619906",
      "cited_by_count": 0,
      "importance": 1,
      "score_basis": {},
      "role": "root",
      "reading_url": "items/092b5762-3de2-4672-94f7-95b01d81de28.html",
      "summary": "研究在 120 Gbaud 双偏振 QPSK、3 × 50 km G.654.E 光纤链路上，比较了省略接收端盲相位搜索（BPS）与采用 64 符号块长 BPS 时的纵向功率分布估计精度。仿真显示，省略 BPS 通常可降低均方根误差（RMSE），提高入纤光功率可使这一优势延续到更宽的激光线宽。实验中，线宽为 100 kHz、入纤光功率为 8–16 dBm 时，两种方案的 RMSE 相近。线宽为 3 Hz、入纤光功率为 14 dBm 时，省略 BPS 使估计精度提高 0.36 dB，同时带来 0.3 dB 的 Q 因子损失。",
      "summary_basis": "本站解读 · abstract-only"
    },
